  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to pilot the Programme for International Student Assessment (PISA) in low income countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support to pilot the Programme for International Student Assessment (PISA) in low income countries is a component of Better Education Statistics for Improved Learning (BESt) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;900,000. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Education policy and administrative management, Education facilities and training.</narrative>
  </description>
